WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.488
Local processing can keep most video and inference data under the operator's direct control.

00:00:06.488 --> 00:00:15.068
This can support privacy goals, data residency, limited retention, and clearer decisions about which event clips leave the site.

00:00:15.068 --> 00:00:20.719
It also reduces dependence on a third party's storage and model service.

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:27.207
A local system can continue core analysis when internet connectivity is degraded or unavailable.

00:00:27.207 --> 00:00:32.858
Alerts may remain on the local dashboard until an external channel returns.

00:00:32.858 --> 00:00:40.183
This is useful for remote facilities, unreliable connections, and environments where continuous cloud upload is impractical.

00:00:40.183 --> 00:00:47.926
Local workflows may reduce recurring bandwidth, storage, and inference charges, especially when many high-resolution streams are involved.

00:00:47.926 --> 00:00:56.507
They can also provide low-latency event handling because frames do not need a round trip to a remote service.

00:00:56.507 --> 00:00:59.227
The tradeoff is operational ownership.

00:00:59.227 --> 00:01:04.041
Local hardware has finite CPU, GPU, memory, power, and storage.

00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:12.203
The organization must size capacity, maintain drivers and models, monitor health, protect the host, and replace failed components.

00:01:12.203 --> 00:01:16.598
Accuracy does not improve merely because inference is local.

00:01:16.598 --> 00:01:23.086
Model choice, training data, camera placement, weather, lighting, and threshold tuning still determine performance.

00:01:23.086 --> 00:01:29.574
Smaller models that fit the hardware may have different capabilities than larger hosted services.

00:01:29.574 --> 00:01:36.480
Local and cloud processing can be combined selectively, but the data flow should be explicit.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:41.712
Choose architecture by privacy, reliability, cost, latency, capability, and support requirements.

00:01:41.712 --> 00:01:51.548
The best design is the one the organization can operate securely and transparently, not simply the one with the most AI features.
